{"4336300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Health Audit Simulator", "steam_appid": 4336300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>FIND the hazards</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a Health Auditor, employed by the Hazard And Management Intervention for Safety and Health (HAMISH), and inspect every inch of 20 playable environments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336300/extras/01912476cc1644bbbb176f7232cbd1e3.avif?t=1783873981\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>FLAG the hazards</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant your Red Risk Flag, provided for use by the Hazard And Management Intervention for Safety and Health (HAMISH), to mark any hazards you find!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336300/extras/a79979e15e01fa880354880091e9da2c.avif?t=1783873981\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>RATE the hazards</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Categorize and Rank each risk using your Evaluation Tablet, issued by the Hazard And Management Intervention for Safety and Health (HAMISH) for use in your on-site evaluations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336300/extras/b474cb8d2f8803e1c381107d0960a932.avif?t=1783873981\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>FIND the hazards</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a Health Auditor, employed by the Hazard And Management Intervention for Safety and Health (HAMISH), and inspect every inch of 20 playable environments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336300/extras/01912476cc1644bbbb176f7232cbd1e3.avif?t=1783873981\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>FLAG the hazards</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant your Red Risk Flag, provided for use by the Hazard And Management Intervention for Safety and Health (HAMISH), to mark any hazards you find!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336300/extras/a79979e15e01fa880354880091e9da2c.avif?t=1783873981\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>RATE the hazards</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Categorize and Rank each risk using your Evaluation Tablet, issued by the Hazard And Management Intervention for Safety and Health (HAMISH) for use in your on-site evaluations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336300/extras/b474cb8d2f8803e1c381107d0960a932.avif?t=1783873981\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Step into the shoes of a Health Auditor. FIND, FLAG and RATE potential Risks and Hazards across 20 playable environments, between two differing difficulty variants.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, French, Italian, Danish, Finnish, Norwegian, Polish, Romanian, Swedish, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4336300/3b66cd0a76116252561ab1f27491869c7ec90733/header.jpg?t=1783873981", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co